  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵Many developers complain that mobile application development is more difficult than web application development.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They try to follow tutorials online precisely, but the mobile application still doesn't work.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is because mobile platforms evolve rapidly, and tutorials just can't keep up to date.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "My friend had the above situation and failed to get any location update from the location manager.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He added the CoreLocation.framework library to Link Binary,",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, he put the code below, and it seems right.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{% gist 18ab0cc09e57cc2a4e6b AppDelegate.swift %}",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, nothing comes out to the console.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is because, starting from iOS 8, you need to add NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription or NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription, depending on requestAlwaysAuthorization (for background location) or requestWhenInUseAuthorization (location only when foreground).",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's start to build and run the app.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You should see the alert below if you start it for the first time.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You should get an update after tapping Allow.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You may need to adjust the location if you are running the Simulator by choosing a location from Debug -> Location.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I have uploaded the project to https://github.com/neoalienson/CLLocationManagerSample",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager Tutorial and Troubleshooting",
        "url": "/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Good luck, and I hope this tutorial does not become outdated very soon!",
